{# The <form> elements the export-version curation controls submit through.
   `_export_version_pin_button.html.twig` and `_export_version_rename_form.html.twig`
   render their inputs and buttons with `form="export-version-(pin|rename)-<id>"`
   and NO form element of their own, so they can be included inside another
   form (the fill pages wrap their dropdown and banner in the fill form, and a
   nested <form> tag would close it — see the pin partial). Include this ONCE
   per page, OUTSIDE every other form, with every version the page renders
   controls for: `ExportHistory::menu(loaded)` on the fill pages,
   `ExportHistory::all()` on the history page. The anchors are empty and
   hidden — a `display: none` form still submits.

   `turbo: true` (the fill pages) opts the anchors into Turbo under the
   site-wide `<html data-turbo="false">`: Turbo submits them by fetch and the
   controllers answer with a Turbo Stream that re-renders the menu body, the
   banner and THIS wrapper (`#export-version-form-anchors` — a version that
   just entered the "recent" rows needs an anchor of its own to be curatable)
   instead of a reload that would throw the fill form's state away. The
   stream needs to know which version the page has loaded (the banner it
   re-renders), hence the `loaded` field. The history page passes neither:
   there the whole page is the list and its redirect loses nothing.

   Expects:
   - versions:        list<TemplateExportVersion>
   - turbo:           bool (default false)
   - loaded_version:  null|TemplateExportVersion (fill pages) #}
{% set turbo = turbo ?? false %}
{% set loaded_version = loaded_version ?? null %}
<div id="export-version-form-anchors" hidden>
    {% for version in versions %}
        <form id="export-version-pin-{{ version.id }}" action="{{ path('template_export_version_pin', {'versionId': version.id}) }}" method="post" class="d-none" data-export-version-pin-form="{{ version.id }}"{% if turbo %} data-turbo="true"{% endif %}>
            {% if loaded_version %}<input type="hidden" name="loaded" value="{{ loaded_version.id }}">{% endif %}
        </form>
        <form id="export-version-rename-{{ version.id }}" action="{{ path('template_export_version_rename', {'versionId': version.id}) }}" method="post" class="d-none" data-export-version-rename-form="{{ version.id }}"{% if turbo %} data-turbo="true"{% endif %}>
            {% if loaded_version %}<input type="hidden" name="loaded" value="{{ loaded_version.id }}">{% endif %}
        </form>
    {% endfor %}
</div>
